ight-mayhem-codex.webp","A playable raccoon character in a 3D museum, with crew rescue objectives and security patrols.","https://simonw.github.io/raccoon-heist-codex/",[86],[461,462,463],{"_63":96,"_31":97},{"_63":464,"_31":465},{"_63":94,"_31":95},"Three.js","/resources/threejs/",[467],{"_63":468,"_31":469,"_104":470},"Read the published Codex transcript","https://github.com/simonw/raccoon-heist-codex/blob/main/transcript.md","The creator links this development record from the build account; it accompanies the game source rather than a generator-only repository.",[472],{"_63":473,"_31":474,"_104":475},"Open the complete game project","https://github.com/simonw/raccoon-heist-codex/","Actual game source, committed textures, vendored Three.js, build notes, and transcript. No build step is required; use a local static HTTP server to run the repository.",[477],{"_63":478,"_31":458,"_104":479},"Play Moonlight & Mayhem","Desktop: WASD or arrows to move, E to interact, Space or Shift to dash, Escape to pause. Mobile uses a touch stick and action buttons. Requires a WebGL-capable browser.",[481],{"_63":482,"_31":483,"_104":-7},"Read the creator’s build and fix log","https://simonwillison.net/2026/Aug/7/moonlight-mayhem/",[485,486,487,488],"Play the heist and trace crew rescue, security detection, interactions, and escape.","Read the creator’s build account and compare the original brief with the result.","Follow the transcript and commit history to study scene construction, generated art, and the visual bug fix.","Serve the complete repository locally, then study one mechanic and its supporting assets.","Simon Willison documents giving Codex the game brief and image-generation access, then requesting a visual bug fix. The published project includes the game, generated textures, and the development transcript.","3D","Asset creation tools",false,[495],"assetTools","gpt-image-2","Three.js · JavaScript",[495],"3d",[485,486,487,488],{"_63":482,"_31":483,"_23":166},{"_63":478,"_